#: manual/query-api.md:106
msgid "Lifecycle and rules"
msgstr ""

#: manual/query-api.md:108
msgid "Call from the game's main thread, as with any game code."
msgstr ""

#: manual/query-api.md:109
msgid "The items belong to the shop. Use them while it is loaded and let them go when the scene changes. Keeping one keeps the whole store in memory after the player leaves it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/query-api.md:110
msgid "Nothing is cached between calls: each `Run` walks the whole shop once. Run a query when you need an answer, not every frame."
msgstr ""

#: manual/query-api.md:111
